exit: 0
stdout:
{"reference":["Preview by default. --confirm destroys managed resources (including Compose","volumes) and removes the lease only on success. A failed cleanup retains the","lease for retry. Statuses: preview, released, already_done. Refusal reasons:","wrong_machine, ambiguous. Refusals exit 3; cleanup failures exit 1. down is an alias.","Examples:","  dibs release \u003cid\u003e","  dibs release \u003cid\u003e --confirm","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Contract 1 (reconcile, reclaim, explain, extend, release, and --pending/--key):","exit 0 success with status; 1 operation failed, records retained; 2 usage;","3 refusal, nothing changed, with a stable reason: not_found, wrong_machine,","not_pending, already_leased, key_conflict, handle_exists, handle_mismatch,","resource_absent, resource_unknown, ambiguous, owner_alive, owner_unknown,","expired, owner_dead, job_deadline. Extend success is renewed or reattached.","Exit 1 is only for operation failures. Output carries contract: 1.","See docs/consumer-contract.md.","","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;","75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child","was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait","failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.","76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).","Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure."],"usage":"dibs release \u003cid\u003e [--confirm] [--axi | --json]"}
